# Outlaw Stitcher counts "each spell you've cast this turn other than the first": only its controller's spells. On turn 3 Bot1
# casts Mox Pearl (its first spell) and then the Stitcher (its second); Bot2 answers the Stitcher with a Lightning Bolt at Bot1, a
# spell cast this turn but not by Bot1. The Zombie Rogue gets two counters for the Stitcher alone (a 4/4), not four.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Outlaw Stitcher
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Outlaw Stitcher.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 17
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Zombie Rogue Token.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Zombie Rogue Token.Power = 4
